{"id":"E13","kind":"edit","editClass":"rule_delete","baseWorld":"C03","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"remove","path":"/sim/rules/detect/condition/operands/1"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E13.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E13.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"ruleConditionOperandCount('detect')","op":"==","rhs":1}},{"rid":"E13.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":true},{"rid":"E13.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E13.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E13.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"protectedObservation","value":{"expr":"entityCountByRole('agent')"}}]}
{"id":"E14","kind":"edit","editClass":"rule_delete","baseWorld":"C09","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"remove","path":"/sim/state/timers/round"},{"op":"remove","path":"/sim/rules/roundEnd"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E14.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E14.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"timerExists('round')","op":"==","rhs":false}},{"rid":"E14.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"danglingRefCount()","op":"==","rhs":0}},{"rid":"E14.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":true},{"rid":"E14.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E14.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"}],"note":"E14.e3 je jádro téhle třídy: smazat timer a nechat viset pravidlo, které na něj odkazuje, je nejčastější tichá vada."}
{"id":"E15","kind":"edit","editClass":"rule_delete","baseWorld":"C01","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"remove","path":"/sim/rules/unlock"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/entities/exit/locked"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E15.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E15.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"entity('exit').locked","op":"==","rhs":false}},{"rid":"E15.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":true},{"rid":"E15.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E15.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E15.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"protectedObservation","value":{"expr":"entityCountByRole('collectible')"}}],"note":"Odemčený východ dělá svět triviálnějším, ale NE insta-win: hráč pořád musí k východu dojít. Verifikátor to musí potvrdit, ne předpokládat."}
{"id":"E16","kind":"edit","editClass":"topology_rewire","baseWorld":"C04","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/entities/torch/socket"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/layout/portals"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/grid"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E16.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E16.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"sameRoom('torch','chest')","op":"==","rhs":true}},{"rid":"E16.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E16.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E16.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E16.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"protectedObservation","value":{"expr":"rule('openChest').condition"}}],"note":"Tvrdá třída, podlaha 0,75. Kužel dopadu je širší než změněná pole: mění se navigační mřížka, tedy i délka svědka."}
{"id":"E17","kind":"edit","editClass":"topology_rewire","baseWorld":"C08","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/layout/kind"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/layout/portals"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/sockets"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/grid"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E17.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E17.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"layout().kind","op":"==","rhs":"ring"}},{"rid":"E17.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"portalCount()","op":"==","rhs":4}},{"rid":"E17.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E17.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E17.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E17.e7","layer":"edit","kind":"protectedObservation","value":{"expr":"entityCountByRole('agent')"}}],"note":"Nejtvrdší případ v sadě: mění typ layoutu, portály, sockety i mřížku najednou, a přesto smí sáhnout jen na deklarované cesty."}
{"id":"E18","kind":"edit","editClass":"topology_rewire","baseWorld":"C01","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/layout/portals"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/sockets"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/grid"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/entities/door2"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/entities/door3"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/rules/chain"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/collisionAabb/door2"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/collisionAabb/door3"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E18.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E18.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"entityCountByRole('door')","op":"==","rhs":3}},{"rid":"E18.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"reachableWithoutOrder()","op":"==","rhs":false}},{"rid":"E18.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E18.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E18.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"}],"note":"E18.e3 je to podstatné: 'každé otevřené předchozím' znamená VYNUCENÉ pořadí. Patch, který tři dveře jen postaví vedle sebe, poruší právě tuhle jednu podmínku."}
{"id":"E19","kind":"edit","editClass":"topology_rewire","baseWorld":"C02","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"add","path":"/sim/layout/levels/1"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/layout/portals"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/grid"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/entities/ladder"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/collisionAabb/ladder"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E19.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E19.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"levelCount()","op":"==","rhs":2}},{"rid":"E19.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"allSocketsReachable()","op":"==","rhs":true}},{"rid":"E19.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E19.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E19.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E19.e7","layer":"edit","kind":"protectedObservation","value":{"expr":"timer('flood').durationTicks"}}],"note":"E19.e3 je v P1 kontrolovatelné jen replayem svědka — plný validátor layoutu je P5 T505. Známá mezera, deklarovaná v protokolu."}
{"id":"E20","kind":"edit","editClass":"topology_rewire","baseWorld":"C03","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/layout/kind"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/grid"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/patrol/actions/0/route"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E20.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E20.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"layout().kind","op":"==","rhs":"corridor"}},{"rid":"E20.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E20.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E20.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E20.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"protectedObservation","value":{"expr":"rule('detect').condition"}}],"note":"Trasa agentů je součást deklarovaného dopadu. Kdyby nebyla v allowedPaths, statický kužel dopadu by patch odmítl — a to by byl FALEŠNÝ negativ, ne nález."}
{"id":"E21","kind":"edit","editClass":"goal_swap","baseWorld":"C01","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/win/event"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/win/condition"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/state/counters/keysReturned"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E21.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E21.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"rule('win').condition.ref","op":"==","rhs":"keysReturned"}},{"rid":"E21.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E21.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E21.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E21.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"winRuleCount()","op":"==","rhs":1}}],"note":"E21.e6 chytá nejčastější selhání výměny cíle: nový cíl PŘIDANÝ vedle starého, takže svět jde vyhrát oběma způsoby."}
{"id":"E22","kind":"edit","editClass":"goal_swap","baseWorld":"C02","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/win/event"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/win/condition"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/drown/actions/0/kind"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E22.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E22.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"rule('win').event.kind","op":"==","rhs":"onTimerEnd"}},{"rid":"E22.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"winRuleCount()","op":"==","rhs":1}},{"rid":"E22.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E22.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E22.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"}],"note":"win() a lose() si vyměňují podmínku na TÉMŽE timeru. Patch, který nechá obě viset na onTimerEnd, vyrobí nedeterministický výsledek — proto e3."}
{"id":"E23","kind":"edit","editClass":"goal_swap","baseWorld":"C06","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/win/condition"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/state/counters/coins"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/rules/earn"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E23.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E23.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"rule('win').condition.ref","op":"==","rhs":"coins"}},{"rid":"E23.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"rule('win').condition.rhs","op":"==","rhs":10}},{"rid":"E23.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"winRuleCount()","op":"==","rhs":1}},{"rid":"E23.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E23.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E23.e7","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E23.e8","layer":"edit","kind":"protectedObservation","value":{"expr":"counter('day')"}}],"note":"Čítač dní ZŮSTÁVÁ (protected), jen přestává být cílem. Patch, který ho smaže, poruší e8 — a smazal by nosič, na kterém visí E02."}
{"id":"E24","kind":"edit","editClass":"goal_swap","baseWorld":"C09","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/win/condition"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/state/counters/streak"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/rules/miss"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E24.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E24.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"rule('win').condition.ref","op":"==","rhs":"streak"}},{"rid":"E24.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"rule('miss').actions[0].kind","op":"==","rhs":"lose"}},{"rid":"E24.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"counterResetOnMiss('streak')","op":"==","rhs":true}},{"rid":"E24.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E24.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E24.e7","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"}],"note":"'Pět v řadě' vyžaduje stav, který svět neměl. e4 je ta netriviální půlka: bez resetu při minutí to není série, jen přejmenované skóre."}
{"id":"E25","kind":"edit","editClass":"goal_swap","baseWorld":"C03","verdictCeiling":"FULFILLED","allowedPaths":[{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/win/event"},{"op":"replace","path":"/sim/rules/win/condition"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/rules/tag"},{"op":"add","path":"/sim/state/counters/tagged"}],"requirements":[{"rid":"E25.e1","layer":"edit","kind":"changedLeavesWithin","value":"allowedPaths"},{"rid":"E25.e2","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"rule('win').condition.kind","op":"==","rhs":"countInZone"}},{"rid":"E25.e3","layer":"edit","kind":"postcondition","value":{"expr":"winRuleCount()","op":"==","rhs":1}},{"rid":"E25.e4","layer":"edit","kind":"witnessPreserved","value":false},{"rid":"E25.e5","layer":"edit","kind":"revisionBumped","value":{"which":"sim","by":1}},{"rid":"E25.e6","layer":"edit","kind":"notNoOp"},{"rid":"E25.e7","layer":"edit","kind":"protectedObservation","value":{"expr":"rule('detect').condition"}}],"note":"Cíl se přesouvá z POZICE na AGREGACI přes dynamickou množinu agentů. Detekce zůstává v platnosti (e7) — hráč pořád může prohrát, jen vyhrává jinak."}
